%description:
Tests the blackhole detection of TCP Fast Open (RFC 7413 section 4.1.3.1:
the client caches negative responses). Connection 1 caches the cookie.
The tester deletes the SYN of connection 2, which carries the cookie and 200
bytes, and its first retransmission. The third transmission of the SYN
suggests a path that drops Fast Open SYNs (as in Linux), so Fast Open stops
for fastopenBlackholeTimeout (3600 s). The SYN-ACK acknowledges only the SYN,
and the first ACK carries the 200 bytes. Connection 3 asks for Fast Open at
t=20 s, but its SYN carries no Fast Open option and no data, as in Linux.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=1s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.cli_app.tOpen3=20s
*.cli_app.active3=true
*.cli_app.localPort3=1002
*.cli_app.tSend3=20s
*.cli_app.sendBytes3=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen3=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=1s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000
*.srv_app.tOpen3=20s
*.srv_app.localPort3=2000

*.tcptester.script="a3 delete; a4 delete"
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[10.001 A005] A.1001 > B.2000: S 250000:250000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[20.001 A007] A.1002 > B.2000: S 5000000:5000000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Fast Open: suspected blackhole 1, no Fast Open until t=3610
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
